1.1.0 (2026-08-11)
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/83
- Added modular optional startup media support.
- Added YES MAN, The Enclave, The Brotherhood of Steel, Mothman, The Minutemen, and Enclave PIP-BOY.
- Added TITLE.BIN as the single title-image format.
- Cleaned startup selection and playback code following review feedback.
- Removed runtime APPINFO self-registration; pip-boy.com creates registration from metadata.json.
- Preserved the hardware-tested startup animation/audio behavior.
